     "S32"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "No failures appeared on 096988dd, 09a95ffa, 0cf6368d, 0dbb91dd, 0e899dd3 or 12855a41. Most of their settings got a single run, so they are only lightly searched, not shown safe. The one well-repeated setting there, 12855a41 with the car 1.5 s later at 1.0x and the ego at 0.8x, did not fail and its range stays low.",
