    "claim": "Across scenes, the at-fault failures are lateral: the policy drifts or steers into a car in the adjacent lane. None is a failure to brake for a lead car, and no run left the road. Every failing setting has the ego off its recorded speed (0.6x, 0.8x or 1.4x).",
